# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
import lib/cadkernel/brep_sweep_path_transport.dl

function check path transport {boolean:condition}:
    execute:
        if condition = false:
            @intrinsic("call", "libc", "abort", nothing)

set value to a cad vector3 with x 1.0, y 0.0 and z 0.0
set alongX to a cad vector3 with x 1.0, y 0.0 and z 0.0
set alongY to a cad vector3 with x 0.0, y 1.0 and z 0.0
set oppositeX to a cad vector3 with x -1.0, y 0.0 and z 0.0
set quarter to the cad path sweep transport of value from alongX to alongY
check path transport quarter's valid
check path transport ((the cad distance from quarter's value to alongY) < 1e-12)
set opposite to the cad path sweep transport of value from alongX to oppositeX
check path transport opposite's valid
check path transport ((the cad distance from opposite's value to oppositeX) < 1e-12)
print "parallel_and_antiparallel_transport" as a line

set frame to a cad path sweep frame at (the cad zero vector3) with x alongX and y (the cad z axis)
set moved to the cad path sweep moved frame frame from alongX to alongY between (the cad zero vector3) and (a cad vector3 with x 0.0, y 3.0 and z 0.0)
check path transport moved's valid
check path transport ((the cad distance from moved's value's origin to (a cad vector3 with x 0.0, y 3.0 and z 0.0)) < 1e-12)
check path transport ((the cad distance from moved's value's xAxis to alongY) < 1e-12)
print "frame_moves_with_path" as a line

set cut to the cad path sweep miter of frame at (the cad zero vector3) between alongX and alongY
check path transport cut's valid
check path transport ((the cad distance from cut's value's xAxis to (the cad zero vector3)) < 1e-12)
set twisted to the cad path sweep twist of frame about (the cad zero vector3) by 1.5707963267948966 scaled 2.0
check path transport twisted's valid
check path transport ((the cad distance from twisted's value's xAxis to (a cad vector3 with x 0.0, y 0.0 and z 2.0)) < 1e-12)
print "miter_and_twist" as a line
